# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# testCodeChube/ working data
#
# The folder itself is kept (compose.py and the images it needs to run), but the
# per-update churn is not:
#
#   needed to edit/   1.9 MB of raw game art, re-downloaded on every update
#   results/          1.7 MB, and 42 of its 43 files are byte-identical to
#                     images/psychube_icon/5/ which is already committed
#   _placeholder5/    frame variants that neither compose.py nor the editor uses
#   _placeholder6/
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
testCodeChube/needed to edit/
testCodeChube/results/
testCodeChube/_placeholder5/
testCodeChube/_placeholder6/

